    (uuid "0e530182-b3a2-41b4-b647-d7b139f4e2a6")
  )
  (text "SERIAL LINK ACROSS THE BARRIER (SPI mode 3, <= 1 MHz; PIO or SPI0)\nGPIO2 SCK -> U4 -> ISO_SCK     GPIO3 MOSI -> U5 -> ISO_MOSI    GPIO5 LOAD -> U6 -> ISO_LOAD\nGPIO6 OE_N -> U7 -> ISO_OE_N    GPIO4 MISO <- U8 <- '165 chain    GPIO7 PRINT <- U9 <- DVM pin 34 (IRQ)\n\nISO_LOAD low   : all five '165s capture the 36 DVM outputs (asynchronous parallel load).\nISO_LOAD rising: both '595s latch the command word shifted in during the previous transfer.\nTransfer = pulse LOAD, then 56 SCK clocks:\n  MISO bits 1-40 : U13 D7..D0, U12 D7..D0, U14, U15, U16 D7..D0 (U16 D3..D0 = 0,0,1,1 signature)\n  MISO bits 41-56: loop-back of the previous 16-bit command word (U17 QH' -> U16 DS)\n  MOSI bits 41-56: new command word (first bit ends in U17 QH, last bit in U18 QA)\n  Always resend the full command word - every LOAD edge re-latches the '595s.\nISO_OE_N is held high (R16 + opto idle) until firmware drives GPIO6 low after writing a valid word,\nso with USB unplugged or the MCU in reset the DVM inputs float to their own defaults (front panel usable).\n\nMeter-side logic is 74LVC at 3.3 V: inputs 5.5 V tolerant, V_IH 2.0 V (DVM high >= 2.4 V via 6k),\nIoff on all outputs - the DVM is never back-powered and pin 38 (FRONT PANEL LOCKOUT) is never pulled\nlow while this board is unpowered. RN1-RN9 (100k) keep the '165 inputs defined if the DVM is off.\nSAMPLE: contact closure on pin 39 via Q1 (U18 QA high = closed), or >100 us pulse on pin 40 (U18 QC, 3.3 V).\nNOTE: the Section 9 tables disagree on whether pin 42 or 43 is the AC-select bit - confirm on the instrument.\n\nBit map (MISO bit 1 first; each '165 D7..D0, DD-50 pin in brackets):\n  U13: BCD6_1(1) DATA_CAN_CHANGE(35) PRINT_LEVEL(34) BCD1_8(18) OVERLOAD(36) BCD5_4(3) BCD1_4(19) BCD5_8(2)\n  U12: BCD5_1(5) BCD1_1(21) BCD1_2(20) BCD5_2(4) BCD0_4(23) BCD4_4(7) BCD4_8(6) BCD0_8(22)\n  U14: BCD4_1(9) BCD0_1(25) BCD0_2(24) BCD4_2(8) POL_NEG(27) BCD3_4(11) BCD3_8(10) POL_POS(26)\n  U15: BCD3_1(13) FN_OUT_29(29) FN_OUT_28(28) BCD3_2(12) RNG_OUT_2(31) BCD2_4(15) BCD2_8(14) RNG_OUT_4(30)\n  U16: BCD2_1(17) PRINT_PULSE(33) RNG_OUT_1(32) BCD2_2(16) then D3..D0 = 0,0,1,1 signature\n  U18 QA..QF: SAMPLE_CONTACT_DRV CMD_FPL_N(38) CMD_SAMPLE_PULSE(40) CMD_RATIO_N(41) CMD_FN_42(42) CMD_FN_43(43); QG-QH unused\n  U17 QB..QH: CMD_INT_4(44) CMD_INT_2(45) CMD_INT_1(46) CMD_AUTORANGE_INH(47) CMD_RNG_1(48) CMD_RNG_2(49) CMD_RNG_4(50); QA unused"
    (at 20.32 259.08 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "046c41c3-5b7e-4009-9dbd-97899a940f74")
  )
